        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-4-chvykov-low-rattling-c4-breakdown-slope-at-alpha-0-90-with-exit-rates-fixed>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-4-chvykov-low-rattling-enrichment-p-ss-r-0-08-p-ss-r-1-25-alpha-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-4-chvykov-low-rattling-fitted-log-log-slope-of-p-ss-vs-r-exit-alpha-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-5-polycomputing-xor-and-or-truth-table-agreement-from-s-a-b>,
