        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-8-multicellular-pd-viability-breakeven-defector-tie-strict-dominance-k-at-b-2-c-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-bib-dois-resolving-via-crossref-with-title-and-author-list-of-record>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-documented-outcome-values-that-disagree-with-the-code-s-output>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-laws-whose-python-evaluation-is-a-dynamical-linear-algebraic-or-combinatorial-computation-whose-asserted-outcome-is-not-fixed-by-construction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-lean-theorems-binding-at-least-one-universally-quantified-parameter-that-appears-in-the-conclusion>,
