    dct:description "Positives: all 15 bib DOIs resolve via Crossref (checked 2026-10-24) with title, volume and locator of record for 14; every one of the 8 laws has at least one DOI; all 63 video IDs resolve in the catalog; the catalog's `mappedMathLaws` now carries the 8-law + concepts taxonomy (spot-checked: Chvykov -> math-4, Cervera -> math-2, Albantakis -> math-7, Weinberg -> concepts) and its SHA-256 is pinned in code, asserted, and recorded in README L9 (closes R4); hoel2026ce2 has a verification note; the OSF URL returns 200. Deductions: the Ross DOI is wrong for the second time - 10.1017/9781009301435 resolves nowhere (Crossref 'Resource not found', doi.org 404) while the Element is 10.1017/9781009300940 and dated 2025 (-7); `froese2024` keeps a paraphrased title and adds a co-author (Karelin) that the Crossref record does not list, under a 'Crossref-verified' note (-4); Stoica (Law 5 name L768), Morozov (Law 8 name L810, docs L49/L66) and Albantakis (Law 7 name) are named as sources with no DOI, URL or bib entry (-5); 'Sweet (2026) Sweet Rationalism' (docs L34) has no identifier (-2); Law 1 lists Beane and Pezzulo scripts under implemented_by but the synthesis neither imports nor calls them (-3); no crawl or regeneration script for the catalog is committed (-3); the Hoel bib title carries a 'Causal emergence 2.0:' prefix absent from the Crossref record (-1); Ross year given as 2024 (-1)." ;
