    rdfs:comment "Pass 3 count was 3 of 8 (Laws 3 and 4 were correct-by-construction, Law 1 unremediated). Law 3's G_gj spread and Law 8's threshold comparison remain same-expression checks inside otherwise genuine computations" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy "script" ;
    schema:about "None. This is a cross-law synthesis / aggregator module. No organism, tissue, specimen image, experimental dataset or published figure is loaded or compared; Law 7's data come from the repository's own S_6 sorting simulation" ;
    schema:unitText "laws_of_8" ;
    schema:value 6e+00 .

