    rdfs:comment "Agreement is now a convergence result, not a construction: the edge ratio (1 - dv/2)/(1 + dv/2) differs from exp(-dv) at O(dv^3). The user's closure note quoted 0.036 % at N = 120; the script gives 0.00218 % (0.036 % would correspond to N ≈ 30)" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy "script" ;
