<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/levin-youtube-channel-math-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Law 2: Cervera, Levin & Mafe (2020) Voltage-Gated Bell-Boltzmann Gap-Junction Bistability & Wound Isolation Law" ;
    dct:description "O1/T2 biophysical ODE integrated on a 20-cell chain: voltage-gated G_ij isolates a 5-cell depolarized wound (-10 mV) so healthy tissue stays at -60.0 mV (vs -10.0 mV collapse in ungated ohmic control) | Variables: V_i: transmembrane voltage; G_{ij}: symmetric voltage-gated Bell-Boltzmann conductance; V_th=-35 mV: gating threshold; V_0=5 mV: thermal slope" ;
    dct:source "Cervera, Levin & Mafe (2020) J. Phys. Chem. Lett. 11:3234 (doi:10.1021/acs.jpclett.0c00641); @drmichaellevin [PIrHLnmI_9o], [-dJSvsP4fzo], [ZCNi05m1Fmg]" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L231-L277>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean#L71-L97> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gj_bell_denom (b_i b_j : Nat) : Nat := (1 + b_i) * (1 + b_j)
def gj_pair_current (g_ij v_i v_j : Int) : Int := g_ij * (v_j - v_i)
theorem cervera_levin_mafe_gap_junction_wound_isolation
    (b_i b_j b_dep : Nat) (g_ij v_i v_j : Int) (h_dep : b_i < b_dep) :
    gj_bell_denom b_i b_j = gj_bell_denom b_j b_i ∧
    gj_pair_current g_ij v_i v_j + gj_pair_current g_ij v_j v_i = 0 ∧
    gj_bell_denom b_i b_j < gj_bell_denom b_dep b_j
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "C_m dV_i/dt = -I_ion(V_i) + ∑_j G_{ij}(V_i, V_j)(V_j - V_i),   G_{ij} = G_0 / [(1 + exp((V_i - V_th)/V_0))(1 + exp((V_j - V_th)/V_0))]" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.patter.2025.101472>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tree.2015.11.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1017/9781009300940>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.0c00641>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s42003-025-08411-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1314922110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1080/01621459.1966.10502008>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsif.2017.0425>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.abc6182>,
        <https://doi.org/10.3389/fbioe.2016.00055>,
        <https://doi.org/10.3389/fnsys.2022.768201>,
        <https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2019.02688>,
        <https://doi.org/10.3390/biomimetics8010110>,
        <https://doi.org/10.3390/e25050748>,
        <https://doi.org/10.3390/e26040288>,
        <https://doi.org/10.3390/ijms24010285> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Load-Bearing Mathematical Laws of Multiscale Bioelectricity, Low-Rattling Selection, Polycomputing, Natural Induction GRNs, Causal Emergence 2.0 & Multicellular Game Theory" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "LoopLevinYouTubeChannelMath.gj_bell_denom" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "LoopLevinYouTubeChannelMath.cervera_levin_mafe_gap_junction_wound_isolation" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/levin-youtube-channel-math-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Law 3: Pietak & Levin (2016, 2017) Nernst-Planck Zero-Flux Boltzmann Electrophoresis & G_gj Cancellation Law" ;
    dct:description "O1/T2 electrodiffusion law discretized via central differences (without imposing exp(-dv) per edge) across N_ap = 15..240 and 5 values of G_gj in [0.2..5.0], proving O(h^2) convergence to exp(40/25.85) = 4.699184 and exact G_gj cancellation (spread = 0.0) | Variables: c: intracellular 5-HT+ concentration; z=+1: valence; ΔV: AP voltage difference; G_gj: gap-junction permeability" ;
    dct:source "Pietak & Levin (2016) Front. Bioeng. Biotechnol. 4:55 (doi:10.3389/fbioe.2016.00055); (2017) J. R. Soc. Interface 14:20170425 (doi:10.1098/rsif.2017.0425); @drmichaellevin [L0D4FdJ4K3g], [7UqncReYvso], [SRV1oLRXeE4]" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L283-L331>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean#L107-L129> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def nernst_planck_scaled_flux (g_gj grad_ln_c z_dV : Int) : Int :=
  g_gj * (grad_ln_c + z_dV)
theorem pietak_levin_nernst_planck_boltzmann_invariant
    (g_gj grad_ln_c z_dV : Int) (h_open : g_gj ≠ 0) :
    nernst_planck_scaled_flux g_gj grad_ln_c z_dV = 0 ↔ grad_ln_c = -z_dV
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "J_s = -G_gj [∇c + (z F / R T) c ∇V] = 0  ⟺  ln(c_post / c_ant) = -z F ΔV / (R T)   (for all G_gj ≠ 0)" ;
