<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/levin-youtube-channel-math-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Law 4: Chvykov et al. (2021) Low-Rattling Fluctuation-Dissipation Attractor Selection Law" ;
    dct:description "O1/T2 statistical-mechanics law solved from a 24-state Markov generator L with strictly fixed exit rates r_exit(i) (slope = -1.0000 at α=0, enrichment = 15.625x) and an unconfounded C4 breakdown sweep across non-doubly-stochastic routing bias α in [0, 0.90] | Variables: r_exit(x): fixed state exit rate; P_ss(x): stationary probability solved from generator L^T p = 0; α_bias: non-doubly-stochastic routing bias" ;
    dct:source "Chvykov et al. (2021) Science 371(6524):90-95 (doi:10.1126/science.abc6182); @drmichaellevin [mOWfZncXt_g], [K8BmMU1Tm-I], [k9lGNyPHurQ]" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L337-L404>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean#L137-L160> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def chvykov_flux_product (p_ss r_exit : Nat) : Nat := p_ss * r_exit
theorem chvykov_low_rattling_platonic_attractor_selection
    (p_sym p_bulk r_sym r_bulk : Nat)
    (h_flux : chvykov_flux_product p_sym r_sym = chvykov_flux_product p_bulk r_bulk)
    (h_pos : 0 < p_bulk) (h_low_rattling : r_sym < r_bulk) :
    p_bulk < p_sym
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "P_ss(x) r_exit(x)^γ = C,   0 < P_ss(bulk) ∧ r_exit(sym) < r_exit(bulk) ⟹ P_ss(sym) > P_ss(bulk)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.patter.2025.101472>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tree.2015.11.009>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1017/9781009300940>,
